## Xcode project is generated by XcodeGen from project.yml and committed
## (Xcode Cloud); only user state is ignored
*.xcworkspace
# Xcode Cloud writes xcshareddata/xcodecloud/manifest.json when the project is
# connected: two UUIDs, nothing secret, but local bookkeeping that Xcode
# recreates on its own (hygie-ios builds on Xcode Cloud without it).
Dingmark.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcodecloud/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/

## Icon renders for the web and the stores (regenerated by render-icon.swift)
design/icon/out/

## Build products
build/
DerivedData/
*.ipa
*.xcarchive

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved

## macOS
.DS_Store

## Local tooling
.claude/

## Never commit credentials or the local signing team
Config/Signing.local.xcconfig
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
